{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.BindingRecurrenceSpectral","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingRecurrenceSpectral","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Sqrt","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.lambdaPlus_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.lambdaPlus_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingRecurrenceSpectral.lean#L90-L98","doc":"**Extensive growth.** For `τ > 2` the dominant root exceeds `1`; with\n`λ₊ · λ₋ = 1` this forces `λ₋ < 1`. The depth-2 binding kernel therefore has a\ngrowing (extensive) general solution — the property a saturating multiplicative\ntrace (`τ = 2`, `λ = 1`) lacks. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.lambda_product_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.lambda_product_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingRecurrenceSpectral.lean#L80-L88","doc":"**det = 1**: the two roots are reciprocal, `λ₊ · λ₋ = 1` (the constant term). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.lambdaPlus_isRoot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.lambdaPlus_isRoot","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingRecurrenceSpectral.lean#L70-L78","doc":"`λ₊` is a root of the characteristic polynomial `x² − τx + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.lambdaMinus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.lambdaMinus","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingRecurrenceSpectral.lean#L67-L68","doc":"Sub-dominant root of the depth-2 binding kernel `x² − τx + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.lambdaPlus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.lambdaPlus","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingRecurrenceSpectral.lean#L64-L65","doc":"Dominant root of the depth-2 binding kernel `x² − τx + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}